=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Hari Pakhroib} (I-11), who wants {@i:Wild Pamamas|4596} {i:Wild Pamamas|Wild Pamamas|4596}.
** {@i:Wild Pamamas|4596} {i:Wild Pamamas|Wild Pamamas|4596} drop off {m:Young Opo-opo} in {z:Yuhtunga Jungle}.
** They can also sometimes be found on the Auction House.
** Despite what the NPC says, you **don't** need to bring {@i:Ice Cluster|4105} {i:Ice Cluster|Ice Cluster|4105}s, as there are no Flame Spouts on the path we'll be taking.
* Head to {z:Ifrit's Cauldron} using the entrance from (G-6) in {z:Yhoator Jungle}.
** The {p:Survival Guide} can also bring you there.
* Once inside {z:Ifrit's Cauldron}, take the left path at the fork and continue on until you find the **Altar of Ashes** located at (I-9) on map 2. It's a black pillar near the edge of the path.
** Alternatively, utilize {p:Unity} 125 teleport to travel quickly to Map 3, taking exit G > A > B to quickly reach (I-9) of Map 2.
* Trade the {@i:Wild Pamamas|4596} {i:Wild Pamamas|Wild Pamamas|4596} to the Altar.
** The NPC mentions needing to shout your name, but that's not necessary.
* Return to {n:Hari Pakhroib} for your reward.

